[en.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_EQUIP_MAGIC_2]
Evil Enchantress

[en.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_EQUIP_MAGIC_2_desc]
She’s an evil enchantress\nShe does evil dances\nAnd if you look deep in her eyes\nShe’ll put you in trances\nThen what will she do?\nShe’ll mix up an evil brew\nThen she’ll gobble you up\nIn a big tasty stew\nSoooo... Watch out!

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_EQUIP_MAGIC_2]
邪恶女巫

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_EQUIP_MAGIC_2_desc]
她是一位邪恶女巫\n她跳着邪恶的舞蹈\n如果你深深地看着她的眼睛\n她会让你陷入恍惚\n然后她会做什么呢？\n她会调制一种邪恶的药水\n然后她会把你吞掉\n在一锅美味的炖菜里\n所以... 小心！

